---
import {
  ChartBarIcon,
  LightBulbIcon,
  Squares2x2Icon,
  UserGroupIcon,
  LightBulbIcon,
  ChatBubbleBottomCenterTextIcon,
  UserGroupIcon,
  Cog8ToothIcon,
} from "@iksaku/heroicons-astro/20/solid";
---

<section class="px-6 py-6 md:py-16 bg-[#FFF0E2]" data-aos="fade-up">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-12 px-8 lg:px-10 text-center">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#0d476d]">Why Our Clients Rely on Us Every Time</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-ls text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto md:text-center">
      Off-the-shelf tools can’t solve your unique challenges. That’s why we build personalized workflows, automations, and messaging that align with your business goals. No more one-size-fits-all solutions, steep learning curves, or surprise fees.
      </p>
  </div>

    <!-- Process Wrapper -->
  <div class="relative px-[10px] md:px-0" data-aos="zoom-in">

    <!-- Desktop Curve Line -->
    <img src="../src/img/client.png"
         class="hidden md:block w-4xl mx-auto pointer-events-none" />

    <!-- Mobile Curve Line -->
<section class="md:hidden" data-aos="zoom-in">

    <!-- Hexagon Image -->
    <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
        <div class="w-32 h-32 bg-center bg-cover"
             style="clip-path: polygon(25% 6%, 75% 6%, 100% 50%, 75% 94%, 25% 94%, 0% 50%);
                    background-image:url('../src/img/polygon.png');">
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Item 1 -->
   <div class="text-center mb-10">
  <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
    <span class="flex-shrink-0 shadow-md rounded-lg">
      <ChartBarIcon
        class="h-8 w-8 m-2"
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </span>
  </div>

  <h3 class="font-semibold text-black text-[16px]">
    Proven ROI, Backed by Data
  </h3>

  <p class="text-gray-600 text-[16px] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
    Our strategies drive measurable ROI with data-backed decisions and optimized workflows tailored to your goals.
  </p>
</div>


    <!-- Item 2 -->
  <div class="text-center mb-10">
  <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
    <span class="flex-shrink-0 shadow-md rounded-lg">
      <Squares2x2Icon
        class="h-8 w-8 m-2"
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </span>
  </div>

  <h3 class="font-semibold text-black text-[16px]">
    Seamless, Integrated Systems
  </h3>

  <p class="text-gray-600 text-[16px] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
  We connect your CRM, marketing, and analytics into one intuitive system backed by 24/7 expert support. Your team can focus on growth, not juggling dashboards.
  </p>
</div>

    <!-- Item 3 -->
     <div class="text-center mb-10">
  <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
    <span class="flex-shrink-0 shadow-md rounded-lg">
      <LightBulbIcon
        class="h-8 w-8 m-2"
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </span>
  </div>

  <h3 class="font-semibold text-black text-[16px]">
    Deep Curiosity & Continuous Improvement
  </h3>

  <p class="text-gray-600 text-[16px] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
   We’re always experimenting, measuring, and refining to uncover new opportunities and help your business succeed in the long run.
  </p>
</div>

    <!-- Item 4 -->
     <div class="text-center mb-10">
  <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
    <span class="flex-shrink-0 shadow-md rounded-lg">
      <ChatBubbleBottomCenterTextIcon
        class="h-8 w-8 m-2"
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </span>
  </div>

  <h3 class="font-semibold text-black text-[16px]">
    Meticulous, Customer-Centric Approach
  </h3>

  <p class="text-gray-600 text-[16px] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
    We put you first, offering personalized journeys, proactive support, and continuous feedback loops that improve over time
  </p>
</div>

    <!-- Item 5 -->
     <div class="text-center mb-10">
  <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
    <span class="flex-shrink-0 shadow-md rounded-lg">
      <UserGroupIcon
        class="h-8 w-8 m-2"
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </span>
  </div>

  <h3 class="font-semibold text-black text-[16px]">
    Collaborative, Transparent Partnership
  </h3>

  <p class="text-gray-600 text-[16px] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
  From clear communication and aligned objectives to shared roadmaps, we work hand-in-hand with you to achieve your goals, with full transparency every step of the way.
  </p>
</div>

    <!-- Item 6 -->
     <div class="text-center">
  <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
    <span class="flex-shrink-0 shadow-md rounded-lg">
      <Cog8ToothIcon
        class="h-8 w-8 m-2"
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </span>
  </div>

  <h3 class="font-semibold text-black text-[16px]">
    Innovation Without the Hassle
  </h3>

  <p class="text-gray-600 text-[16px] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
 We use cutting-edge tools and automation to streamline processes and accelerate growth without the friction.
  </p>
</div>

</section>
  </div>
</section>




